# Quantifier: the rule holds for the known members and stays in the IR for future ones.
The module "dispatch" contains the registry "STRATEGIES".
The registry "STRATEGIES" contains the strategy "nearest", the strategy "round robin" and the strategy "zone".
Every strategy in the registry "STRATEGIES" receives the value "floor" and the list "candidates".
Every strategy in the registry "STRATEGIES" returns the record "Elevator".
Every strategy in the registry "STRATEGIES" never changes the record "Elevator".
Every strategy in the registry "STRATEGIES" is deterministic.
# an explicit sentence equal to an expansion is not duplicated
The strategy "zone" returns the record "Elevator".
# empty set: warning
Every strategy in the module "simulator" returns the value "None".
# errors: quantified subject outside the frame, quantifier in the condition
Every module in the program "p" starts in the state "x".
If every strategy in the registry "STRATEGIES" returns the value "None", the module "simulator" skips the list "waiting".
